      "writtenOn": "2023-10-13T00:02:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Based on Core v5.3, Vol 4, E, 7.5.4. Valid RSSI is represent in 1-byte with the range:\n  + BR/EDR: -128 to 127\n  + LE: -127 to 20, 127\n\nFor an LE transport, the RSSI parameter returns the absolute receiver signal strength value in dBm to +/-6dB accuracy. If the RSSI cannot be read, the RSSI metric shall be set to 127.\n\nI am comfortable using 127 as an invalid RSSI value, but with a more descriptive comment.",
      "parentUuid": "5e215530_5f447e6a",
      "revId": "47ff9373c8d2fdbe695fc61f645ca15150e66072",
